    {
      "id": "06186a1aa70fb5bacceb029775438c3f",
      "url": "https://fmhy.net/posts/sept-2026",
      "title": "Monthly Updates [Sept]",
      "content": "<div class=\"info custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">INFO</p>\n<p>These update threads only contain major updates. If you're interested\nin seeing all minor changes you can follow our\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fmhy/FMHYedit/commits/main\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Commits Page</a> on GitHub or\n<a href=\"https://redd.it/17f8msf\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Updates Channel</a> in Discord.</p>\n</div>\n<h1 id=\"wiki-updates\" tabindex=\"-1\">Wiki Updates <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#wiki-updates\"></a></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>The sites search engine now has <strong><a href=\"https://i.ibb.co/99gXbTyD/image.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Section Filters</a></strong> / <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/J1csfSu.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2</a> (Gaming, Audio, Reading etc.) which can improve the quality of results in some situations. TY to anarchydr for doing this.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Added a <strong><a href=\"http://fnp47tywqhwygfkkik3dkgreocdbevjslzs6fw4zbotomcbqeuyahjqd.onion/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">.onion</a></strong> version of FMHY to our backups page. TY to @saber for making this.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Added a FMHY <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/mian196/fmhy-bookmarks-extension\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bookmark Extension</a></strong> w/ Auto Updates. TY to @Simon Riley for making this.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>FMHY <strong><a href=\"https://www.raycast.com/akshit_mehta/fmhy-search\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Raycast Search Extension</a></strong> is now available, thank you to its contributors for the idea + doing this for us.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Added <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/S67dReX.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Query Parameter</a> / <a href=\"https://i.ibb.co/yFyybyfX/Untitled.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2</a> support (?q=searchquery). Example: <code>https://fmhy.net/?q=test</code>. TY to @flower for doing this.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Re-ordered <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/video#anime-streaming\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Anime Streaming Sites</a> based on the <strong><a href=\"https://challonge.com/woium3fu/fullscreen\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Polls</a></strong> and conversations that took place during them, thank you to everyone who voted and congrats to all sites that got bumped higher or maintained their high spots. <a href=\"https://i.ibb.co/JW4dqsH7/Untitled.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Before vs After</a> / <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/sNqUdG7.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Electronics shopping has become really bloated, so we've decided to split it into some new subsections to help make it easier to navigate. TY to @jochen for the idea. New subsections: <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/misc#electronics-tech\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Electronics / Tech</a>, <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/misc#mobile-phones\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mobile / Phones</a>, <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/misc#cameras\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cameras</a>, <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/misc#pc-hardware-building\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">PC Hardware / Building</a>, <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/misc#tv-monitors\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TV / Monitors</a>, <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/misc#audio-equipment\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Audio Equipment</a>, <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/misc#keyboards-mice\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Keyboards / Mice</a>, <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/misc#gaming-equipment\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gaming Equipment</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Added section for <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/educational#ai-ml-learning\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AI / ML Learning</a> to Educational.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Added section for <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/educational#military-conflict-history\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Military / Conflict History</a> to Edu History. TY to @Yeet for the idea + collecting sites.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Added section for <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/gaming#racing-driving\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Racing / Driving</a> to Browser Games.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Added section for <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/misc#random-sites-discovery\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Random Sites / Discovery</a> under Indexes.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Minecraft Tools category has been <a href=\"https://i.ibb.co/svg60Qp2/Untitled.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">thoroughly revised</a> / <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/7V6rWeo.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>. This included reorganizing and condensing some lines to try to help make it easier to navigate. TY to @Myuui, @Flower, @Jul Mik, @Yoshi/MTG, @litekin for helping with this.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Removed the mutual exclusion between Toggle Starred + Toggle Indexes, both switches can now be enabled at the <a href=\"https://i.ibb.co/gMHfjG08/image.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">same time</a> / <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/sqPgOK3.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>. TY to Zenith for doing this.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h1 id=\"stars-added-\u2b50\" tabindex=\"-1\">Stars Added \u2b50 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#stars-added-\u2b50\"></a></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/gaming#download-games\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GoG Revived</a> in Game Downloads, 1:1 archive of gog-games with updates.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/misc#indexes\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Dans Guides</a> in Indexes as they're nicely-written and have become well liked by many people.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/video#download-sites\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">downloadeverythingfromeverywhere</a> in Video Download Sites, aggregator that scrapes multiple hosts, including some single click ones.</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/mobile#social-media-apps\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">raincord</a> in Mobile Social Media Apps, modded discord client for Android &amp; iOS, successor to Kettu, has plugins, good dev team, and seems to be working well for those currently using it.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/video#stream-aggregators\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Movy</a> in Stream Aggregators, fast streams, high quality UI, one of the better sites to come out in last few months.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/gaming-tools#steam-epic\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">LuaTools</a> in Steam Tools, Steam multi-tool + manifest tool similar to SteamMidra but smoother and doesn't trigger defender.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/audio#curated-recommendations\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Shfl</a> in Music Recommendations, recommendations from music writers + artists, has big catalogue, guides, thematic lists and <a href=\"https://i.ibb.co/jP4w9jzF/image.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">more</a> / <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/129i3Dk.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/reading#book-recommendations\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NPR's Books We Love</a> in Book Recommendations, <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/px72ucF.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">reflects thousands</a> / <a href=\"https://i.ibb.co/Kxw7L73t/image.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2</a> of hand-picked recommendations from their hundreds of reporters, critics and staff members.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/mobile#image-galleries\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Refra + Right Gallery</a> in Android Image Galleries, both have very nice UIs, lots of features, and were well liked by those who tried them.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/gaming-tools#hosting-tools\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Crafty Controller</a> in Minecraft Hosting Tools, cross-platform server controller that works in browser, has file uploads, modpack imports and more.\u2060</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/linux-macos#linux-gaming\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">SLSsteam</a> in Linux Gaming, Steamclient Mod w/ DLC Unlocker and emulated achievements.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/ai#multiple-model-sites\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Together.ai</a> in Multi Model Sites, has good daily limits, solid free models, and web search.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/audio#internet-radio\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AccuRadio</a> in Internet Radio, pre-programmed, themed channels spanning hundreds of styles, infinite skips and <a href=\"https://i.ibb.co/6JwVfm8Q/image.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">more</a> / <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/ODhkBNk.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/audio#music-discovery\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NTS Radio</a> in Music Discovery, led by a global community of more than <a href=\"https://i.ibb.co/HDYDQWXB/image.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">600 resident hosts</a> / <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ckHCwU.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, including musicians, DJs, artists, and record collectors, alongside guest shows and special programming.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/gaming-tools#moba-tools\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Rose</a> in MOBA Tools, LoL Skin Manager / Unlocker, safe to use, no reports of anyone having any sort of issues, has every single skin in the game (on your screen only).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/mobile#social-media-apps-1\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">RyukGram</a> in iOS Social Media, actively maintained Instagram tweak, works well for those who tried it, seems to be the best current option.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/mobile#ios-audio\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">8SPINE</a> in iOS Audio, module-based streaming + downloading app, has nice UI, lots of settings, and lossless playback (with certain modules).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/educational#multi-language\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Yomitan</a> in Language Learning, feature-rich browser popup dictionary, has custom themes, anki integration and more.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/ai#coding-benchmarks\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DeepSWE</a> in Coding Benchmarks, very reliable, frequently updated, and tests all reasoning strengths of models.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Starred <a href=\"https://fmhy.net/ai#local-ai-frontends\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cherry Studio</a> in Local AI Frontends, has a easy setup + nice UI.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h1 id=\"things-removed\" tabindex=\"-1\">Things Removed <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#things-removed\"></a></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Removed nitter + xcancel as both have been forced to <a href=\"https://i.ibb.co/tjszjwK/image.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shut down</a> / <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/j3HYkmB.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2</a> by X.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Unstarred Netlify as they no longer provide their 10GB / 100GB bandwidth plan, and have instead switched to a credit system that gives much less.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Unstarred squid(wtf) as it now only supports KHInsider &amp; JioSaavn.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
